+## Basis/Continuum Policy
+Basis and continuum are mandatory validation controls. They answer whether an
+improvement is numerical/stable. They are not free fit knobs. A pair candidate
+that improves only at one small basis and collapses under larger virtual spaces
+must be rejected even if its raw full RMS is lower.
